# Build-time generated output (SP06 `prebuild`: scripts/generate-og-cards.mjs).
# `public/` is copied verbatim into `dist/` by `vite-react-ssg build`, and
# `prebuild` always regenerates these before that copy happens — same
# "regenerated every build, nothing to commit" status as `dist/` itself, just
# staged one directory earlier.
